              is non-trivial, but it is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Morita+equivalence"} Morita equivalent
              to the terminal groupoid object.
          %h4#SmoothGrooupoidPrincipalBundles Smooth groupoid-principal bundles
